{"path":"types/endian","title":"std::endian","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>endian","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/endian","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"Indicates the endianness of all scalar types:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/bit\">&lt;bit&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">enum</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> endian<br><span class=\"br0\">{</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; little <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* implementation-defined */</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; big &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* implementation-defined */</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; native <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* implementation-defined */</span>,<br><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Indicates the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Endianness#Overview\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">endianness</a> of all <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/type\">scalar types</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li> If all scalar types are little-endian, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">native</span></span></code> equals <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">little</span></span></code>.\n</li><li> If all scalar types are big-endian, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">native</span></span></code> equals <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">big</span></span></code>.\n</li></ul>\n<p>Corner case platforms are also supported:\n</p>\n<ul><li> If all scalar types have <code>sizeof</code> equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>, endianness does not matter and all three values, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">little</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">big</span></span></code>, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">native</span></span></code> are the same.\n</li><li> If the platform uses mixed endian, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">native</span></span></code> equals neither <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">big</span></span></code> nor <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">little</span></span></code>.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw2\">enum</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> endian\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#if defined(_MSC_VER) &amp;&amp;&nbsp;!defined(__clang__)</span>\n    little <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span>,\n    big    <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>,\n    native <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> little\n<span class=\"co2\">#else</span>\n    little <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> __ORDER_LITTLE_ENDIAN__,\n    big    <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> __ORDER_BIG_ENDIAN__,\n    native <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> __BYTE_ORDER__\n<span class=\"co2\">#endif</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_endian\"><code>__cpp_lib_endian</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/20#cpp_lib_endian_201907L\"><code>201907L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++20)</span></td>\n<td><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span></span></code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;bit&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">native</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">big</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"big-endian<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">else</span> <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">native</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">endian</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">little</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"little-endian<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">else</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"mixed-endian<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>mixed-endian</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/byteswap\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>byteswap</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  reverses the bytes in the given integer value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/bit/endian\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>endian</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"types","title":"Type support (basic types, RTTI)"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::endian","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Indicates the endianness of all scalar types:"},{"label":"Possible implementation"},{"label":"Notes"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"byteswap","note":"reverses the bytes in the given integer value"}]}]},"standards":["C++20","C++23"],"wordCount":182,"codeBlockCount":3}
